WEBVTT

00:27.160 --> 00:30.560
♪Peach blossoms fall,
yesterday's trace fades away♪

00:30.800 --> 00:34.080
♪Ahead lie storms and winds,
our fates like drifting clouds sway♪

00:34.400 --> 00:40.040
♪Alas, I roam through what remains,
fate's grip won't set me free♪

00:41.400 --> 00:44.920
♪If time would spare me
just one breath to stay♪

00:45.520 --> 00:48.920
♪If you could see
the depth of my belief♪

00:49.120 --> 00:55.680
♪Alone I enter the game,
every move made with no regret in me♪

00:56.080 --> 01:00.040
♪Though shackles bind my soul
and chain my form♪

01:00.160 --> 01:03.240
♪I've walked
through life and death before♪

01:03.320 --> 01:10.200
♪I fear not fate's cruel temptations,
I've severed every cause♪

01:10.400 --> 01:14.440
♪In this life our threads entwined,
in love and pain we crossed♪

01:14.600 --> 01:17.480
♪But I'll keep my word
no matter the cost♪

01:17.560 --> 01:19.960
♪Forged in stardust and flame♪

01:20.040 --> 01:25.800
♪I rise with an unyielding frame♪

01:35.120 --> 01:36.960
=The Princess's Gambit=

01:37.040 --> 01:39.440
(Adapted from the novel "Peach Blossoms
Reflecting the River and Mountains")

01:39.520 --> 01:42.000
(by Bai Lu Cheng Shuang)

01:42.160 --> 01:44.920
=Episode 19=

01:46.360 --> 01:47.000
Prince Wuxia.

01:47.920 --> 01:48.680
Prince Wuxia!

01:49.640 --> 01:50.400
Prince Wuxia!

01:51.120 --> 01:51.840
Prince Wuxia!

01:54.480 --> 01:55.280
Jiang Taohua…

01:56.720 --> 01:58.400
You would go against Her Highness?

01:58.680 --> 01:59.600
You're as good as dead.

02:00.840 --> 02:01.600
If that's the case,

02:02.120 --> 02:02.720
don't fault me

02:02.800 --> 02:04.640
for trading your life
for a shot at survival.

02:07.000 --> 02:07.600
Get up!

02:09.720 --> 02:10.680
Shen Zaiye.

02:11.120 --> 02:12.200
Quite the grand entrance.

02:13.120 --> 02:14.040
If you've got the guts,

02:14.520 --> 02:15.640
tell your men to shoot me.

02:15.720 --> 02:16.360
No!

02:16.440 --> 02:18.400
If she dies,
she'll take the Princess with her!

02:18.720 --> 02:19.400
Princess!

02:19.920 --> 02:20.960
Princess!

02:35.560 --> 02:36.320
I know who you are.

02:37.480 --> 02:38.520
You run Lan Boutique,

02:38.680 --> 02:39.440
Yang Wanqing.

02:40.160 --> 02:41.320
You entered the palace at 12,

02:42.000 --> 02:43.960
and became Empress Lv's
personal maid in Beiyuan.

02:44.600 --> 02:45.320
Eight years later,

02:45.800 --> 02:47.760
you were banished
for disrespecting your mistress.

02:48.360 --> 02:49.840
You came to Qi to make a living.

02:50.640 --> 02:51.400
But clearly,

02:51.960 --> 02:52.720
there's more to it.

02:55.560 --> 02:56.480
Shen Zaiye.

02:57.000 --> 02:58.160
Look at the situation.

02:59.000 --> 03:01.200
Do you really think
you have everything under control?

03:01.920 --> 03:03.080
Does it even matter who I am?

03:03.760 --> 03:04.680
What matters is that

03:05.080 --> 03:06.040
everyone you care about

03:07.160 --> 03:08.520
is in my hands now.

03:09.160 --> 03:10.440
Whoever you're working for,

03:11.920 --> 03:13.200
they're not worth

03:13.280 --> 03:14.360
dying for.

03:14.920 --> 03:16.160
Whatever promises she made you,

03:17.000 --> 03:18.000
whatever deal you struck,

03:18.600 --> 03:19.800
I can give you the same.

03:21.080 --> 03:22.280
Turn yourself in,

03:22.800 --> 03:23.840
and I'll spare your life.

03:27.000 --> 03:28.040
Shen Zaiye.

03:29.080 --> 03:30.320
Everyone in Qi

03:31.320 --> 03:33.160
knows how ruthless and cunning you are.

03:34.960 --> 03:36.160
If I let them go now,

03:36.720 --> 03:38.480
you'd have me stuck
with arrows in no time.

03:39.560 --> 03:41.560
If you don't want them
end up as corpses,

03:42.480 --> 03:43.560
tell your men to back off.

03:44.120 --> 03:45.200
Prepare a carriage for us.

03:46.280 --> 03:47.600
Once we've left the mountain,

03:47.760 --> 03:48.840
I'll release them.

03:51.240 --> 03:52.200
But if you refuse,

03:54.040 --> 03:55.200
then these two

03:56.800 --> 03:58.040
shall die with me.

04:04.240 --> 04:05.600
You're more naive than I thought.

04:05.920 --> 04:07.920
Since Jiang Taohua
is a spy from Beiyuan,

04:08.240 --> 04:09.560
why would I care if she is dead?

04:33.040 --> 04:34.800
The only person
walking away from this alive

04:35.600 --> 04:36.880
is Prince Wuxia.

04:50.400 --> 04:51.040
Chancellor Shen,

04:51.320 --> 04:52.520
the Princess did nothing wrong.

04:52.600 --> 04:54.000
Please! I'm begging you, save her!

04:59.200 --> 05:00.200
Jiang Taohua.

05:01.680 --> 05:03.120
My heart aches for you.

06:15.920 --> 06:17.280
Shen Zaiye!

06:17.560 --> 06:18.760
I'll kill you!

06:18.840 --> 06:20.360
Someone send Qingtai back to the house!

06:21.160 --> 06:21.760
Let go of me!

06:23.480 --> 06:24.480
I'm not going back!

06:25.160 --> 06:26.080
I'm going to Beiyuan.

06:26.920 --> 06:28.920
I'll tell the Heir
you killed the Princess.

06:29.080 --> 06:30.160
He'll avenge her!

06:36.320 --> 06:36.920
Chancellor.

06:37.200 --> 06:37.960
Maybe the Princess…

06:38.040 --> 06:38.800
Not another word!

06:41.160 --> 06:42.280
The Princess is no more.

06:44.320 --> 06:45.360
The two who fell

06:46.840 --> 06:48.600
were spies committing espionage.

06:50.320 --> 06:53.400
They were traitors from a rival nation,
plotting against our royal bloodline.

06:56.840 --> 06:58.240
Search the cliff base.

07:00.920 --> 07:02.360
I want them found

07:05.120 --> 07:05.840
dead

07:08.120 --> 07:09.000
or alive.

07:10.720 --> 07:11.320
Yes, sir.

07:11.400 --> 07:17.960
♪I've watched time drift gently by♪

07:18.960 --> 07:25.960
♪I sketch and paint the sky
and your silhouette♪

07:27.560 --> 07:28.240
(Zhengchun Boudoir)

07:28.360 --> 07:35.360
♪I carve as a sharp knife,
with no answers for morality♪

07:36.360 --> 07:40.720
♪Even if it's nothing but an illusion♪

07:40.800 --> 07:44.560
♪You are still my one and only♪

07:46.040 --> 07:47.280
(Things have come to this.)

07:48.920 --> 07:50.160
(Better to part ways.)

07:51.520 --> 07:52.760
(Drink this farewell wine.)

07:53.920 --> 07:55.760
(After tonight,)

07:56.240 --> 07:57.600
(we will never meet again.)

08:10.600 --> 08:11.240
Zhan Lu.

08:12.880 --> 08:13.480
Chancellor.

08:14.960 --> 08:16.240
Take down the Zhengchun Boudoir's

08:17.480 --> 08:18.120
plaque.

08:18.960 --> 08:19.560
Yes.

08:20.520 --> 08:22.160
What about the Princess's belongings?

08:22.240 --> 08:23.120
You heard me.

08:24.240 --> 08:25.600
There is no princess here.

08:27.800 --> 08:29.800
Go through
the spy's belongings carefully.

08:30.440 --> 08:31.880
Keep anything we can use as evidence

08:32.559 --> 08:33.400
and seal it all up.

08:34.320 --> 08:34.960
As for the rest,

08:37.280 --> 08:38.080
destroy it.

08:40.679 --> 08:41.280
Chancellor.

08:41.559 --> 08:43.280
What should we do with Miss Qingtai?

08:45.360 --> 08:46.720
She said she'd head back to Beiyuan

08:46.800 --> 08:48.800
to bring the troops here
and avenge Jiang Taohua.

08:50.240 --> 08:51.040
So be it.

08:52.640 --> 08:54.720
Have all the spies
from Lan Boutique been caught?

08:55.440 --> 08:56.400
Yes, they've locked up.

08:57.200 --> 08:58.360
However, none confessed.

08:59.360 --> 09:00.440
Would you interrogate them?

09:04.640 --> 09:05.240
Talk.

09:05.320 --> 09:05.920
Speak!

09:06.000 --> 09:06.960
Who's pulling

09:07.040 --> 09:08.000
the strings in Yujing?

09:08.640 --> 09:09.560
I don't know.

09:11.320 --> 09:11.920
Speak up!

09:12.400 --> 09:13.000
Talk!

09:14.840 --> 09:15.440
Start talking!

09:19.120 --> 09:19.720
Speak!

09:19.800 --> 09:20.880
- Chancellor.
- Chancellor!

09:23.240 --> 09:24.880
I don't keep useless men under me.

09:25.880 --> 09:27.280
If you can't find the one behind it,

09:27.920 --> 09:28.840
I'll have your heads.

09:29.600 --> 09:30.200
- Yes!
- Yes!

09:30.320 --> 09:30.920
Yes, sir.

09:32.600 --> 09:33.200
Talk!

09:34.720 --> 09:35.840
You treacherous dog…

09:38.960 --> 09:39.560
Wait!

09:44.320 --> 09:45.240
Curse you!

09:53.680 --> 09:54.400
What is this?

09:55.760 --> 09:58.520
The most popular makeup in Yujing.
It's the Peace Blossom makeup.

10:03.160 --> 10:04.200
What is the purpose

10:04.520 --> 10:05.560
of the peach blossom mark?

10:20.560 --> 10:21.920
Is this how your spies from Beiyuan

10:22.720 --> 10:24.880
identify each other?

10:25.400 --> 10:26.880
Anyone bearing the mark

10:27.240 --> 10:28.920
is a spy ready to die for Beiyuan.

10:30.000 --> 10:31.280
Ready to die for Beiyuan?

10:34.160 --> 10:35.240
(She's a princess,)

10:35.680 --> 10:36.760
(she can't be one of them.)

10:38.800 --> 10:40.240
(Besides, I saw it last night.)

10:41.000 --> 10:42.160
(Her arm was clean.)

10:43.440 --> 10:44.560
(Back at the gambling house,)

10:45.280 --> 10:46.400
(she had a mark on her arm,)

10:46.800 --> 10:48.560
(but it was way lighter
than these spies'.)

10:49.800 --> 10:50.960
(But if it was drawn on,)

10:51.640 --> 10:53.440
(it couldn't be identical,)

10:54.080 --> 10:55.080
(with the same location,)

10:55.480 --> 10:56.440
(but different depths,)

10:56.520 --> 10:57.560
(and not always present.)

10:59.040 --> 10:59.960
(Could it be)

11:00.920 --> 11:01.840
(a sign of poisoning?)

11:12.720 --> 11:13.320
Chancellor.

11:13.680 --> 11:14.640
We went easy on her.

11:14.720 --> 11:15.320
She just…

11:15.520 --> 11:16.640
She just dropped dead.

11:17.920 --> 11:19.160
(Blood from all seven orifices.)

11:19.440 --> 11:20.400
(She was poisoned.)

11:21.760 --> 11:23.080
(Could the color of the mark)

11:23.320 --> 11:24.760
(be tied to the onset of poisoning?)

11:29.160 --> 11:30.040
You've seen

11:30.840 --> 11:31.840
how she ended up.

11:33.040 --> 11:34.720
When we searched Yang Wanqing's place,

11:35.600 --> 11:36.880
we found a single pill.

11:37.360 --> 11:39.000
Most likely, it's the antidote.

11:39.640 --> 11:41.120
It might be your only cure.

11:41.480 --> 11:43.240
He has the antidote!

11:43.720 --> 11:45.320
If any of you want to live,

11:46.000 --> 11:47.520
then tell me who is behind all this.

11:48.200 --> 11:49.400
There is only one pill.

11:50.280 --> 11:50.880
The antidote!

11:51.240 --> 11:51.840
The antidote!

11:51.920 --> 11:52.960
Please, sir! Give it to me!

11:53.160 --> 11:54.080
Please, I need it!

11:54.520 --> 11:55.120
The antidote!

11:55.200 --> 11:56.280
Give it to me!

11:57.160 --> 11:59.160
I'll tell you everything!

11:59.240 --> 12:00.640
(Looks like I was right.)

12:01.480 --> 12:02.400
(It really is poison.)

12:04.200 --> 12:05.320
What kind of poison is it?

12:06.520 --> 12:07.120
It's called…

12:07.840 --> 12:09.280
It's called the Jiangtao pill.

12:09.840 --> 12:10.720
It was Empress Lv

12:11.640 --> 12:12.920
who forced us to take it.

12:13.640 --> 12:16.440
The peach blossom mark
shows the poison is active.

12:16.920 --> 12:18.960
She used it to threaten us serving her.

12:19.440 --> 12:21.200
If we don't take
the antidote every month,

12:21.680 --> 12:22.440
at best,

12:22.840 --> 12:23.880
we cough up blood and faint.

12:23.960 --> 12:24.680
In the worst case,

12:24.880 --> 12:25.840
we die instantly.

12:37.280 --> 12:38.000
Empress Lv

12:38.080 --> 12:40.800
also used our families as leverage.

12:41.280 --> 12:43.480
My parents are locked up on her orders.

12:43.960 --> 12:46.160
I just want to see them one last time.

12:46.480 --> 12:47.200
Chancellor Shen…

12:47.560 --> 12:48.480
Please, sir…

12:49.120 --> 12:50.200
My wife and child

12:50.280 --> 12:51.520
are Empress Lv's hostages too!

12:51.760 --> 12:53.160
If I fail the mission,

12:53.320 --> 12:54.520
they'll be killed,

12:54.600 --> 12:55.480
Chancellor Shen.

12:56.360 --> 12:57.320
Chancellor Shen…

12:57.400 --> 12:59.000
So all of you were under her control.

12:59.880 --> 13:00.840
What about Jiang Taohua?

13:02.320 --> 13:03.760
She was the same as us.

13:04.560 --> 13:06.240
She's just another expendable pawn.

13:06.880 --> 13:08.640
She was Princess Chengping,

13:09.400 --> 13:11.160
you can't possibly
be on her level as well.

13:12.640 --> 13:13.560
Treacherous Chancellor,

13:14.360 --> 13:16.000
did you really believe

13:16.760 --> 13:17.480
Beiyuan

13:17.840 --> 13:19.960
would hand over a royal princess

13:20.040 --> 13:21.920
just to be your concubine?

13:24.640 --> 13:25.640
Back then

13:25.880 --> 13:27.200
at the Beiyuan Palace,

13:27.720 --> 13:30.000
Jiang Taohua got down on her knees

13:30.480 --> 13:32.200
just for a bowl of medicine.

13:33.400 --> 13:35.560
You two make a perfect match!

13:39.120 --> 13:39.720
Chancellor.

13:40.960 --> 13:42.160
Chancellor, we found something.

13:44.880 --> 13:46.360
I found this letter under the bed

13:46.440 --> 13:47.320
at Zhengchun Boudoir.

13:48.160 --> 13:49.400
Looks like a letter

13:49.480 --> 13:50.960
from Jiang Taohua's younger brother.

13:51.160 --> 13:53.480
(Are you well, Sister?
Has Chancellor Shen treated you kindly?)

13:53.560 --> 13:54.280
(Signed: Changjue)

13:56.240 --> 13:58.560
(Her brother is held hostage
by Empress Lv.)

13:59.800 --> 14:00.600
(No wonder…)

14:02.000 --> 14:03.520
(Empress Lv)

14:03.600 --> 14:05.080
(also used our families as leverage.)

14:05.560 --> 14:06.840
(If I fail the mission,)

14:07.280 --> 14:08.680
(they'll be killed.)

14:09.000 --> 14:10.880
Why hasn't the scout
sent to Beiyuan returned?

14:11.520 --> 14:13.400
We received a message from him.

14:13.840 --> 14:15.360
He ran into trouble multiple times,

14:15.680 --> 14:17.520
but he should be on his way back now.

14:18.320 --> 14:20.480
Our guards have been searching
Yugui Mountain.

14:20.880 --> 14:22.520
No sign of Jiang Taohua's body.

14:22.840 --> 14:23.920
Nearby boatmen says

14:24.000 --> 14:25.840
the bottom of the cliff
is full of whirlpools.

14:25.920 --> 14:26.680
Anyone who falls

14:26.840 --> 14:27.920
is as good as gone,

14:28.720 --> 14:30.280
and the body likely won't even surface.

14:47.400 --> 14:48.000
Shen Zaiye.

14:51.360 --> 14:51.960
Prince Wuxia.

14:52.720 --> 14:54.280
What happened that day at the teahouse?

14:54.640 --> 14:55.560
Why were you there?

14:58.200 --> 14:58.880
That day,

14:59.320 --> 15:00.840
someone used the Princess's name

15:00.920 --> 15:01.640
to lure me out.

15:02.280 --> 15:04.320
But as soon as I arrived,
I was knocked out.

15:04.560 --> 15:06.000
I was half-conscious,

15:06.200 --> 15:07.720
but I heard them arguing.

15:08.240 --> 15:10.040
After the Princess tricked
that person away,

15:10.680 --> 15:12.120
she tried everything to wake me up.

15:12.680 --> 15:13.960
By the time I came to,

15:14.240 --> 15:15.640
I heard the Princess had already…

15:18.640 --> 15:19.720
Jiang Taohua.

15:21.240 --> 15:22.320
What are you doing?

15:23.160 --> 15:24.480
I said I was saving him,

15:25.320 --> 15:27.080
and you threw me
into the interrogation room.

15:27.800 --> 15:29.400
Is this how you show trust?

15:31.560 --> 15:32.200
So…

15:33.600 --> 15:34.640
She was telling the truth.

15:35.920 --> 15:36.720
Shen Zaiye.

15:37.440 --> 15:38.560
Is the Princess's fate

15:39.320 --> 15:40.440
your doing?

15:41.920 --> 15:43.000
I'm talking to you.

15:43.200 --> 15:44.360
Was it your doing or not?

15:45.000 --> 15:45.640
Mu Wuxia.

15:45.840 --> 15:47.320
It was an accident Jiang Taohua fell.

15:47.440 --> 15:48.760
My brother was trying to save her.

15:49.920 --> 15:50.640
An accident?

15:53.160 --> 15:54.240
It all seems too suspicious.

15:54.320 --> 15:55.640
How could it be just an accident?

15:57.000 --> 15:57.640
I don't buy it.

15:58.640 --> 16:00.200
She was probably killed by him.

16:03.080 --> 16:06.040
(Shen Residence)

16:06.120 --> 16:08.800
(Sister Taohua, it's been so long
since we parted. I think of you often.)

16:08.920 --> 16:10.960
(How is your body?)

16:11.040 --> 16:13.200
(Has Chancellor Shen
treated you with kindly?)

16:22.760 --> 16:23.800
I, Zengtu, have uncovered

16:24.000 --> 16:26.000
the truth behind
the Princess's marriage alliance.

16:26.560 --> 16:27.560
Sorry for taking so long.

16:28.040 --> 16:29.800
Please, Chancellor,
grant me another chance

16:30.800 --> 16:31.800
to make things right.

16:33.160 --> 16:34.320
Tell me everything you found.

16:35.000 --> 16:36.480
I want every detail.

16:37.320 --> 16:37.920
Yes.

16:48.520 --> 16:49.120
Chancellor,

16:49.520 --> 16:51.640
this is everything I managed to uncover.

16:57.640 --> 16:59.480
Princess Chengping
had the title in name only.

17:00.280 --> 17:02.040
She was treated worse
than a palace maid.

17:02.520 --> 17:03.120
Chancellor,

17:03.520 --> 17:05.240
why don't we storm
the Beiyuan Palace now,

17:05.599 --> 17:06.839
and make them pay for her death?

17:08.240 --> 17:08.880
No.

17:11.680 --> 17:12.720
Prince Changjue is still

17:13.440 --> 17:14.440
Empress Lv's hostage.

17:16.720 --> 17:17.800
Go rest and recover.

17:18.359 --> 17:19.240
Thank you, Chancellor.

17:20.000 --> 17:20.800
I'll take my leave.

17:26.240 --> 17:26.839
Chancellor.

17:27.640 --> 17:28.800
What do we do now?

17:30.880 --> 17:32.120
Send more men. Keep searching.

17:36.200 --> 17:36.800
Yes, sir.

17:37.320 --> 17:38.240
Understood.

17:55.960 --> 17:58.600
(Zhengchun Boudoir)

18:14.480 --> 18:15.720
(Peach blossoms in full bloom,)

18:16.040 --> 18:17.280
(bright and blushing red.)

18:18.560 --> 18:20.280
(You really do live up to your name.)

18:22.080 --> 18:26.400
♪The brokenness buried in your brow♪

18:26.760 --> 18:31.640
♪Galloping steeds
pound upon the blue bricks♪

18:34.360 --> 18:35.680
(Since it's wedding wine,)

18:36.160 --> 18:37.560
(it should be shared with you.)

18:38.240 --> 18:43.720
♪With no one to carry dreams
across the rivers wide♪

18:44.920 --> 18:49.200
♪How could one forget fate's
bowed and heavy stride?♪

18:49.640 --> 18:54.680
♪Withered grass forced
to bloom into petals♪

18:56.520 --> 18:57.640
(Drinking alone in silence)

18:57.880 --> 19:00.200
(at this hour of the day, Chancellor?)

19:01.000 --> 19:02.520
Has someone upset you?

19:03.480 --> 19:04.280
Aren't you an expert

19:04.840 --> 19:05.840
is that field?

19:07.760 --> 19:12.560
♪You weren't falling,
no need to feel all the sorrow and joy♪

19:13.560 --> 19:18.480
♪I wasn't someone
meant to wait and hope♪

19:19.240 --> 19:23.600
♪Don't blame my affection
for bringing you cold winds♪

19:23.920 --> 19:27.160
♪We were both unwilling to give in♪

19:29.120 --> 19:30.120
♪Who would've thought♪

19:30.200 --> 19:35.160
♪It began as a trial by fate♪

19:36.320 --> 19:40.800
♪Yet it turned into
a fleeting bond, lost to time♪

19:41.680 --> 19:46.320
♪Worn out from wandering,
with no shelter to rest beneath♪

19:46.440 --> 19:49.120
♪You never complained♪

19:49.280 --> 19:51.760
♪And I lay awake♪

19:52.040 --> 19:53.120
♪Who ever pitied us♪

19:53.200 --> 19:58.120
♪In those long, cold, uncertain years?♪

19:59.440 --> 20:00.160
Chancellor.

20:01.040 --> 20:02.320
We've been searching nonstop.

20:03.120 --> 20:03.880
We found this.

20:04.560 --> 20:09.000
♪Do you know love,
when left unspoken, quietly fades?♪

20:09.240 --> 20:13.600
♪Among a noisy crowd of strangers♪

20:14.840 --> 20:15.880
(Jiang Taohua…)

20:16.760 --> 20:18.280
(I've prayed for you.)

20:18.720 --> 20:19.760
(You won't die.)

20:21.000 --> 20:22.320
(And you can't die.)

20:25.240 --> 20:27.200
(Zhengchun Boudoir)

20:29.600 --> 20:30.920
Princess Chengping!

20:32.080 --> 20:33.240
Princess Chengping!

20:33.880 --> 20:35.040
Princess Chengping!

20:36.640 --> 20:39.440
- Princess Chengping!
- Princess Chengping!

20:40.320 --> 20:41.400
(Heaven,)

20:42.400 --> 20:44.360
(Jiang Taohua has had
a life full of suffering.)

20:45.040 --> 20:46.520
(And yet, she always chose kindness.)

20:47.160 --> 20:48.400
(She would never harm a soul.)

20:49.800 --> 20:50.920
(All she ever wanted)

20:51.800 --> 20:52.920
(was a quiet, peaceful life,)

20:54.000 --> 20:55.120
(for her family to be safe.)

21:04.480 --> 21:05.960
(It was me who brought her to this.)

21:06.800 --> 21:07.880
(If there's any justice,)

21:08.360 --> 21:09.760
(let me be the one to bear it.)

21:11.440 --> 21:13.000
(I, Shen Zaiye, swear before Heaven,)

21:13.600 --> 21:14.840
(let the Buddhas be my witness,)

21:15.600 --> 21:16.960
(may my lifespan)

21:17.120 --> 21:19.080
(be exchanged for a chance
to save Jiang Taohua.)

21:20.280 --> 21:22.040
(Just let her make it through this.)

21:22.120 --> 21:27.520
♪If you walk away, looking back♪

21:27.840 --> 21:33.520
♪How many more years will I lose again?♪

21:33.600 --> 21:36.120
(Changsheng Hall)

21:42.120 --> 21:44.000
My brother has been
searching for Jiang Taohua,

21:44.280 --> 21:45.600
but there's still no sign of her.

21:46.320 --> 21:47.760
Please, I pray to you

21:47.840 --> 21:48.880
to keep her safe and sound.

21:49.440 --> 21:50.280
I swear

21:50.560 --> 21:52.040
that if Jiang Taohua comes back alive,

21:52.120 --> 21:54.160
I'll rebuild every last statue
of the Heavenly Immortals

21:54.240 --> 21:55.360
and give each ten big buns!

21:56.800 --> 21:57.600
And also…

21:59.000 --> 22:01.040
But you don't drink or eat meat, so…

22:01.360 --> 22:02.560
What else would be good?

22:05.320 --> 22:06.200
Miss Qingying,

22:07.000 --> 22:08.160
take a look around.

22:08.240 --> 22:09.360
Do you know where we are?

22:16.320 --> 22:17.280
It's a temple.

22:18.040 --> 22:19.040
The ones worshipped here

22:19.160 --> 22:20.280
are all great sages,

22:20.400 --> 22:21.520
bodhisattvas, and buddhas.

22:22.320 --> 22:23.640
The Heavenly Immortals

22:23.920 --> 22:25.240
are worshipped in Taoist temples.

22:27.640 --> 22:28.720
There's a difference?

22:29.720 --> 22:30.640
I'll say it again.

22:30.720 --> 22:32.400
Dear Buddhas,
please don't take offense.

22:34.440 --> 22:36.240
I'd better go light
a bigger incense stick

22:36.360 --> 22:37.440
to make up for that slip.

22:38.120 --> 22:39.080
That's not necessary.

22:39.560 --> 22:41.120
Buddhas are enlightened beings.

22:41.360 --> 22:42.880
They won't mind something so trivial.

22:43.240 --> 22:43.920
Give that back!

22:44.000 --> 22:44.680
Come on!

22:45.240 --> 22:46.200
- Come here!
- Give it!

22:46.280 --> 22:46.960
Hey!

22:48.800 --> 22:50.080
Sir, please return my manuscript.

22:50.320 --> 22:51.960
It took us forever
to win that girl over.

22:52.040 --> 22:52.960
As soon as you showed up,

22:53.040 --> 22:54.000
she outright ignored us.

22:54.280 --> 22:55.520
You're just a broke scholar!

22:55.720 --> 22:57.000
All you do is recite poems.

22:57.520 --> 22:58.600
You ruined everything for me.

22:58.680 --> 23:00.240
I should rip up your manuscript!

23:09.960 --> 23:12.160
Look at you rat-faced
and weasel-eyed losers.

23:12.320 --> 23:13.920
What kind of girl would fall for that?

23:14.080 --> 23:15.520
You blame him for your own failings?

23:15.680 --> 23:16.720
What a bunch of losers.

23:17.200 --> 23:19.040
A feisty lady hero shows up.

23:19.240 --> 23:20.360
Hot temper aside,

23:20.480 --> 23:22.160
she's just my type.

23:22.880 --> 23:23.480
Boys,

23:23.920 --> 23:24.560
seize her.

23:25.240 --> 23:28.080
I'd like to have a proper duel with her.

23:28.200 --> 23:28.960
Stop right there!

23:31.000 --> 23:32.320
So, Prince Wuxia is here too.

23:32.440 --> 23:33.440
Is something the matter?

23:35.200 --> 23:37.040
Temples are sacred places.

23:37.280 --> 23:39.640
You'd really harass a woman
here of all places?

23:40.000 --> 23:41.800
His Majesty loathes this behavior.

23:42.320 --> 23:43.160
Perhaps

23:43.840 --> 23:46.040
I should report this to him.

23:46.840 --> 23:47.440
We're sorry.

23:47.600 --> 23:48.520
It was just a joke.

23:48.880 --> 23:50.960
Forget us. We'll be on our way now.

23:51.320 --> 23:52.680
We take our leave.

23:52.800 --> 23:53.400
Hold up!

23:56.280 --> 23:56.880
Gentlemen,

23:57.320 --> 23:58.320
Mr. Li here is a dear friend

23:58.400 --> 24:00.200
of mine and Prince Wuxia's.

24:00.640 --> 24:02.000
You'd better not mess with him again.

24:02.080 --> 24:03.000
Of course not, Miss.

24:03.120 --> 24:04.120
No, never again.

24:04.440 --> 24:05.720
Let me give you a word of advice.

24:06.120 --> 24:07.600
Make peace, not grudges.

24:08.040 --> 24:09.640
No more messing around, or else…

24:12.560 --> 24:13.800
(I finally pulled it off once.)

24:17.240 --> 24:18.000
Sorry about earlier.

24:18.080 --> 24:19.160
I'm from the Liu household.

24:19.400 --> 24:21.200
Next time we meet, let's be friends.

24:21.440 --> 24:22.040
Why don't you

24:22.120 --> 24:23.360
have a drink on me?

24:23.840 --> 24:24.480
You're too kind.

24:24.760 --> 24:26.360
It was just a misunderstanding.

24:27.240 --> 24:28.960
You all look like refined gentlemen.

24:29.440 --> 24:30.400
How about I share a poem?

24:30.480 --> 24:32.160
A little literary exchange with friends?

24:36.000 --> 24:37.000
Sounds great!

24:37.360 --> 24:38.560
- Wonderful!
- Excellent!

24:39.160 --> 24:40.840
Dashing as legends of Song Yu go,

24:41.560 --> 24:43.160
unmatched wit to be a true pillar.

24:43.840 --> 24:45.280
Never short of intelligence,

24:46.560 --> 24:48.520
courage bound to serve and blaze.

24:50.120 --> 24:51.760
Eyes still wander when beauty comes.

24:55.640 --> 24:56.640
- Great poem!
- Bravo!

24:56.920 --> 24:57.920
What I meant was,

24:58.280 --> 24:59.400
you have the looks of Song Yu,

24:59.480 --> 25:00.520
and the knowledge of sages.

25:00.760 --> 25:01.840
Exceptional gentlemen

25:01.960 --> 25:03.480
with hearts loyal to the realm.

25:04.040 --> 25:04.960
So of course,

25:05.760 --> 25:08.360
it's only natural
to appreciate a pretty girl.

25:09.040 --> 25:10.200
Well said, my friend!

25:10.280 --> 25:10.880
You there!

25:11.000 --> 25:11.960
Write that down for me.

25:12.240 --> 25:13.640
Turn it into a scroll when we're back.

25:13.720 --> 25:14.800
Hang it in my study!

25:15.760 --> 25:16.360
Let's go.

25:17.120 --> 25:18.480
Prince Wuxia, please carry on.

25:19.880 --> 25:20.800
- Goodbye.
- Goodbye.

25:28.960 --> 25:29.560
Mr. Li!

25:29.920 --> 25:30.520
You…

25:31.000 --> 25:31.960
What's so funny?

25:32.880 --> 25:33.480
By the way,

25:33.720 --> 25:35.520
aren't poems supposed
to come in couplets?

25:35.880 --> 25:37.320
That poem only had five lines.

25:37.400 --> 25:38.200
Something feels off.

25:38.960 --> 25:40.880
If that bunch really knew what's right,

25:41.360 --> 25:42.440
why would they have

25:42.800 --> 25:43.880
no manners left?

25:45.040 --> 25:45.760
So?

25:46.760 --> 25:48.000
What is so funny about the poem?

25:50.400 --> 25:52.680
D-U-N-C-E.

25:53.240 --> 25:54.480
The first letters form a word!

25:54.920 --> 25:55.920
You scholars really know

25:56.000 --> 25:57.440
how to insult people without cursing.

25:59.240 --> 26:01.760
(The manuscript.)

26:02.320 --> 26:03.520
Mr. Li, that's a fine essay.

26:04.560 --> 26:05.480
You flatter me, Mr. Mu.

26:06.000 --> 26:06.960
It's just a rough draft.

26:08.160 --> 26:08.880
Or perhaps…

26:09.240 --> 26:10.600
I should call you Prince Wuxia.

26:12.080 --> 26:13.320
It's just a title, nothing more.

26:13.640 --> 26:14.840
Mr. Li, no need for modesty.

26:15.400 --> 26:16.680
What you've written is excellent.

26:17.240 --> 26:18.520
I'll be sure to recommend you.

26:20.360 --> 26:21.640
Then, I'll polish it some more.

26:21.960 --> 26:23.040
Thank you for the trouble.

26:23.640 --> 26:24.240
Of course.

26:41.120 --> 26:41.720
Chancellor.

26:44.400 --> 26:46.600
You look exhausted.

26:47.520 --> 26:48.600
Even your chess is slipping.

26:49.560 --> 26:51.200
Shall I give you a little jolt?

28:11.760 --> 28:12.720
Thank you, Your Majesty.

28:14.960 --> 28:15.560
Sit.

28:27.920 --> 28:29.960
I've been waiting for your report.

28:30.840 --> 28:32.080
Do you know how long it's been?

28:35.480 --> 28:36.480
Princess Chengping

28:36.720 --> 28:37.920
came for the marriage alliance.

28:38.640 --> 28:40.160
Now she's dead before the wedding.

28:40.560 --> 28:42.560
Are you trying to start a war
between our nations?

28:43.120 --> 28:44.160
How dare you!

28:45.400 --> 28:46.000
Your Majesty.

28:46.360 --> 28:47.920
I had no intention of provoking a war.

28:48.880 --> 28:50.400
After the Princess fell from the cliff,

28:50.600 --> 28:51.880
neither her body nor her remains

28:52.200 --> 28:53.040
have been found.

28:53.640 --> 28:54.720
Her fate remains unknown.

28:55.400 --> 28:56.520
An all-out search is ongoing.

28:57.400 --> 28:58.400
I wanted to report it

28:58.480 --> 28:59.440
after finding her.

29:00.600 --> 29:01.960
But your punishment is timely.

29:03.120 --> 29:04.280
I failed to report it sooner.

29:05.000 --> 29:06.040
I deserve it.

29:08.120 --> 29:09.080
We must decide soon

29:09.160 --> 29:10.120
whether she is dead

29:10.640 --> 29:11.960
or alive.

29:13.160 --> 29:14.240
A letter from Beiyuan says

29:14.480 --> 29:15.760
they're sending a delegation.

29:16.200 --> 29:18.240
If they ask about her whereabouts then,

29:18.560 --> 29:19.880
we need an answer ready.

29:20.920 --> 29:21.640
I put you

29:22.080 --> 29:22.800
in charge of this.

29:23.680 --> 29:24.960
You created this mess,

29:25.280 --> 29:26.080
so you clean it up.

29:31.480 --> 29:32.080
Yes.

29:32.840 --> 29:34.360
I'll see to it right away.

29:46.760 --> 29:48.560
(Shen Residence)

29:48.640 --> 29:50.200
The Empress Lv sending a delegation now

29:50.720 --> 29:52.320
is probably to rebuild the Lan Boutique.

29:54.240 --> 29:55.480
They just won't relent.

29:58.520 --> 29:59.800
Since they've come to us,

30:00.760 --> 30:01.480
we can meet them.

30:02.240 --> 30:03.080
But as for who comes,

30:03.880 --> 30:04.880
I'll decide that myself.

30:07.000 --> 30:07.920
Make a list of the names

30:08.000 --> 30:08.800
Zengtu mentioned.

30:09.040 --> 30:09.840
Send it to Beiyuan.

30:10.440 --> 30:11.040
Yes.

30:16.160 --> 30:17.080
(Jiang Taohua,)

30:18.280 --> 30:19.720
(Where in the world are you?)

30:21.560 --> 30:22.840
(You must be alive,)

30:24.000 --> 30:24.600
(aren't you?)

30:26.160 --> 30:28.840
(Your dearest brother, Prince Changjue)

30:32.560 --> 30:36.360
(Beiyuan Capital, Hao City)

30:39.600 --> 30:40.800
How brazen.

30:41.520 --> 30:44.000
Shen Zaiye is just
the Left Chancellor of Qi,

30:44.840 --> 30:46.800
yet he dares
to appoint Beiyuan's emissaries.

30:47.720 --> 30:48.320
Your Highness,

30:48.400 --> 30:49.680
(Empress of Beiyuan, Lv Yuanhua)

30:49.760 --> 30:50.960
the people appointed by Qi

30:51.800 --> 30:52.520
more or less

30:53.160 --> 30:54.560
have ties to Princess Chengping.

30:56.560 --> 30:58.360
I noticed that too,

30:59.040 --> 31:00.440
which makes me even more confused.

31:01.680 --> 31:03.480
What exactly is he up to?

31:04.400 --> 31:05.080
Your Highness,

31:05.840 --> 31:06.760
if I may,

31:07.520 --> 31:08.960
Shen Zaiye is usually very cautious.

31:09.280 --> 31:10.120
For him to do this

31:10.200 --> 31:11.160
must mean he has a plan.

31:12.520 --> 31:13.720
As for what he wants,

31:14.240 --> 31:15.320
digging too deep is futile.

31:15.880 --> 31:16.480
It's better

31:17.000 --> 31:19.000
to send more capable officials
with the delegation

31:19.360 --> 31:20.400
and play it by ear?

31:21.000 --> 31:21.760
You mustn't forget

31:22.680 --> 31:24.120
the true purpose of this delegation.

31:29.720 --> 31:31.000
You make a good point.

31:32.200 --> 31:33.440
Then let's play along with it,

31:33.720 --> 31:35.000
and see what he's really after.

31:35.480 --> 31:36.880
The extra hands will be

31:37.720 --> 31:38.880
personally selected by me.

31:49.240 --> 31:51.560
I poured my heart and soul
into Lan Boutique.

31:58.400 --> 32:00.000
Mu Wuyin, you useless fool.

32:00.560 --> 32:01.560
You're good for nothing.

32:05.640 --> 32:06.880
Your Highness, please calm down.

32:07.080 --> 32:08.400
You must take care of your health.

32:10.680 --> 32:11.480
Nanny Mei,

32:12.640 --> 32:14.200
I'm feeling a bit unwell.

32:15.160 --> 32:16.520
Go after the State Preceptor

32:16.800 --> 32:18.800
and tell him to act as regent
starting tomorrow.

32:19.640 --> 32:21.840
I'll be spending some time in seclusion.

32:22.040 --> 32:23.280
Yes, Your Highness.

32:38.920 --> 32:39.520
Chancellor.

32:40.000 --> 32:40.840
Any clues?

32:41.080 --> 32:42.680
We searched
the valley three more times.

32:42.960 --> 32:43.800
We scoured every corner

32:43.880 --> 32:44.960
within a hundred li.

32:45.640 --> 32:46.520
Still nothing.

32:59.880 --> 33:00.480
Chancellor,

33:00.840 --> 33:01.760
should we just…

33:07.120 --> 33:08.480
I'll lead the search tomorrow.

33:11.280 --> 33:11.880
Wait.

33:16.320 --> 33:17.360
Gather the patient logs

33:17.440 --> 33:19.200
from every clinic within a hundred li.

33:19.320 --> 33:20.200
I'll check them all.

33:20.960 --> 33:21.560
Understood.

33:24.160 --> 33:25.240
(Since there's no body,)

33:26.040 --> 33:27.760
(there's still a sliver of hope.)

33:38.640 --> 33:39.240
Chancellor,

33:39.640 --> 33:41.960
(Visit Records)
visit records from city clinics.

33:42.640 --> 33:44.160
What exactly are you trying to find?

33:46.080 --> 33:48.120
(We've looked for so long
and found nothing.)

33:49.360 --> 33:50.800
(What if she was rescued?)

33:52.280 --> 33:54.040
(Falling from that height)

33:54.440 --> 33:55.440
(must have injured her.)

33:56.440 --> 33:58.000
(She'd have to see a physician.)

33:59.280 --> 34:01.080
(Such fall injuries are rare cases.)

34:01.840 --> 34:03.080
(By checking the medicine used,)

34:03.720 --> 34:04.680
(and treatment records,)

34:05.560 --> 34:06.880
(we might be able to find a lead.)

35:24.680 --> 35:25.280
Chancellor.

35:25.760 --> 35:26.440
You didn't sleep.

35:26.560 --> 35:27.600
You should have some food.

35:43.320 --> 35:45.080
(Shunjing Residence)
First of the ninth month.

35:45.200 --> 35:47.040
Sixth of the ninth month.

35:48.280 --> 35:49.280
And the thirteenth,

35:49.840 --> 35:50.800
seventeenth,

35:51.640 --> 35:52.560
and twentieth.

35:54.280 --> 35:55.240
And the twenty-seventh.

35:56.680 --> 35:57.280
Found it.

35:59.880 --> 36:01.280
Lin's Clinic has been visiting

36:01.520 --> 36:03.360
Prince Wuyin's residence
every few days.

36:04.640 --> 36:05.760
Prince Wuyin has always been

36:05.840 --> 36:07.040
around people who refine pills.

36:07.560 --> 36:08.800
He's always been in good health.

36:09.760 --> 36:10.360
Besides,

36:11.240 --> 36:12.560
even if Prince Wuyin did fall ill,

36:12.720 --> 36:14.200
they'd call for an imperial physician,

36:14.560 --> 36:15.840
not a regular apothecary.

36:17.760 --> 36:19.000
So you're saying,

36:19.240 --> 36:21.320
the Princess might be in his residence?

36:22.480 --> 36:23.280
It's still unclear.

36:24.320 --> 36:25.040
Bring the portrait.

36:25.120 --> 36:25.720
Come with me.

36:25.800 --> 36:26.400
Yes, sir.

36:34.040 --> 36:34.640
Hyah!

36:36.440 --> 36:37.040
Whoa.

36:39.080 --> 36:41.280
(Lin's Clinic)

36:41.360 --> 36:42.160
Is Physician Lin in?

36:42.280 --> 36:42.880
He's not here.

36:43.000 --> 36:44.560
He's gone to Prince Wuyin's residence.

36:45.800 --> 36:46.400
Let's go.

36:49.640 --> 36:51.960
(Prince Wuyin's Residence)

36:52.080 --> 36:52.680
(Serene and elegant)

37:04.120 --> 37:04.920
Changjue!

37:05.000 --> 37:05.600
Sister!

37:05.680 --> 37:06.280
Stop!

37:06.360 --> 37:06.960
Let go!

37:07.040 --> 37:07.680
Sister!

37:07.760 --> 37:09.800
(Special Envoy Princess Taohua,)

37:10.080 --> 37:11.240
(titled Chengping,)

37:11.320 --> 37:13.480
(shall be sent to Qi State
for the marriage alliance.)

37:13.920 --> 37:14.600
(Shen Residence)

37:15.760 --> 37:16.520
(Do you regret)

37:17.080 --> 37:17.880
(marrying me?)

37:45.640 --> 37:47.680
Your Highness, you're finally awake.

37:51.760 --> 37:52.360
Here.

37:58.800 --> 38:00.000
Your Highness, you have no idea

38:00.160 --> 38:01.760
how worried I've been
these past few days.

38:01.840 --> 38:03.320
I was afraid you wouldn't wake up.

38:04.840 --> 38:05.840
I don't mean to jinx you.

38:06.680 --> 38:07.800
But you're awake now.

38:10.400 --> 38:11.200
Qingtai.

38:13.360 --> 38:14.560
What happened to me?

38:16.920 --> 38:18.280
When I found you,

38:18.520 --> 38:19.800
you were covered in wounds.

38:22.080 --> 38:23.040
Your Highness!

38:28.040 --> 38:30.280
Your Highness! Where are you?

38:33.680 --> 38:34.440
Your Highness!

38:38.840 --> 38:39.480
Your Highness.

38:50.360 --> 38:51.680
Your Highness, thank goodness!

38:51.760 --> 38:53.480
I finally found you!

38:54.080 --> 38:54.720
Your Highness.

38:59.720 --> 39:01.320
I've tended to your wounds carefully.

39:01.400 --> 39:03.280
They've healed quite a bit.

39:04.160 --> 39:06.320
Your Highness, that was Yugui Mountain.

39:06.840 --> 39:08.360
Falling from there and surviving

39:08.440 --> 39:10.120
is nothing short of a miracle.

39:10.800 --> 39:12.240
You're incredibly lucky.

39:15.840 --> 39:16.920
Yugui Mountain…

39:19.920 --> 39:22.160
Was that the mountain
we passed on the way to form

39:22.240 --> 39:23.400
the marriage alliance?

39:25.480 --> 39:26.320
Marriage alliance?

39:27.360 --> 39:28.360
That is…

39:52.840 --> 39:56.040
♪The flower bloomed,
knowing nothing at all♪

39:56.120 --> 39:59.160
♪In splendor, proud and tall♪

40:00.080 --> 40:03.200
♪The flower fell, lashed by the wind♪

40:03.320 --> 40:07.080
♪In a daze,
it felt like lifetimes had thinned♪

40:07.360 --> 40:10.440
♪Petals soaked in rain♪

40:10.560 --> 40:13.880
♪Heartbreak follows again and again♪

40:14.280 --> 40:17.840
♪The flower weeps, burdened by thoughts♪

40:17.920 --> 40:23.640
♪With no one it can be brought♪

40:28.600 --> 40:35.520
♪Wishes struggle through the mire♪

40:35.960 --> 40:42.800
♪Regrets clash in hopeless fire♪

40:43.280 --> 40:50.280
♪Still I hope she'll pick the flower
kissed by dew♪

40:50.600 --> 40:54.640
♪Even if it means this flower♪

40:54.760 --> 41:01.720
♪Will be hers to give to someone new♪

41:12.840 --> 41:15.960
♪Whose eyes
did the flower's heart meet?♪

41:16.040 --> 41:19.280
♪Love and hate held back, discreet♪

41:19.640 --> 41:23.320
♪The flower withers, feelings in decay♪

41:23.440 --> 41:30.000
♪No longer needing to say♪

41:34.080 --> 41:41.000
♪Yet I still long for her in madness♪

41:41.400 --> 41:48.360
♪Unafraid of judgment or sadness♪

41:48.720 --> 41:55.720
♪Remembering the words
she spoke of flowers and skies♪

41:56.080 --> 41:57.760
♪And finding♪

41:57.840 --> 42:04.840
♪They were her gentle heart's reply♪
